{"about_the_game":"Hero Index is a VR Power Suit Action game designed for Valve Index Controller.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE THE SUPER HERO!</strong></h2><br>As the elite soldier wearing the hi-tech robotic armor H.E.R.O ( Humanoid Exo Robotic Outfit ) , you will be on missions of various situations (destroy a small enemy fleet, escort ally ship to escape point, etc...).<br><br>Take off from your own battleship, approach enemy's battleship from any angle you want.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/6bf42bef9c0fe34a013d4d77bee00755.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/6bf42bef9c0fe34a013d4d77bee00755.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/6bf42bef9c0fe34a013d4d77bee00755.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/9b4801b4efee261423a3aa88dabe3a94.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/9b4801b4efee261423a3aa88dabe3a94.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/9b4801b4efee261423a3aa88dabe3a94.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Wipe out all enemies with your deadly arsenals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/46fe05ec2ad96310a0d161e29e975f92.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/46fe05ec2ad96310a0d161e29e975f92.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/46fe05ec2ad96310a0d161e29e975f92.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIGNATURE WEAPONS</strong></h2><br>INDEX LASER : Laser beam emitted from index finger<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/75bfe1491d8f09df0b76e5adb6abd23f.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/75bfe1491d8f09df0b76e5adb6abd23f.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/75bfe1491d8f09df0b76e5adb6abd23f.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>FIST CANNON : Rapid fire triggered by holding your fist<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/a136e0560a1c85335cbb672c10133571.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/a136e0560a1c85335cbb672c10133571.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/a136e0560a1c85335cbb672c10133571.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>LIGHTNING : Electric arcs that will hit multi targets automatically<br><br>ULTRA BEAM : Long range palm laser. Warship killer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLESHIP SUPPORT</strong></h2><br>You are not fighting alone. Your battleship and fighter squadrons fight alongside you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/fed74e1a4f34ea01b1ef9c3137bee439.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/fed74e1a4f34ea01b1ef9c3137bee439.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/fed74e1a4f34ea01b1ef9c3137bee439.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY INDEX CONTROLLER?</strong></h2><br>Hero Index delivers the superhero-like flying experience that everyone has dreamed of. Thanks to the innovative finger tracking of Index Controller, gesture-based fly and weapon control that was impossible with traditional motion controller becomes true for the first time.<br><br>As a game completely designed for Valve Index, Hero Index aggressively adopts finger gesture control without compromise.<br><br>Take the most iconic weapon, the index laser, as an example, <strong>for the first time in video game history, players can aim actually with their own index fingers and fire at will without pressing any button</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN I PLAY IT WITHOUT INDEX CONTROLLER?</strong></h2><br>Sort of. With the latest &quot;Escort&quot; update, Vive Wand and Oculus Touch users can do fly control and use limited weapons now. It is still experimental feature so might have issues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br>Control your fly direction and speed preciously with hand and finger motion.<br>No button is involved.<br><br>Fire your weapon by open your hand, hold your fist, or point with your index finger.<br>Do the right gesture, the right weapon fired, weapon switching can't be more seamless.<br>Again, no button is involved.<br><br>Breathtaking epic space battle experience tailored for the unique control mechanics.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1202560?t=1585403341","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1202560?t=1585403341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1585403341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1585403341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Hero Index is a VR Power Suit Action game designed for Valve Index Controller.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE THE SUPER HERO!</strong></h2><br>As the elite soldier wearing the hi-tech robotic armor H.E.R.O ( Humanoid Exo Robotic Outfit ) , you will be on missions of various situations (destroy a small enemy fleet, escort ally ship to escape point, etc...).<br><br>Take off from your own battleship, approach enemy's battleship from any angle you want.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/6bf42bef9c0fe34a013d4d77bee00755.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/6bf42bef9c0fe34a013d4d77bee00755.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/6bf42bef9c0fe34a013d4d77bee00755.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/9b4801b4efee261423a3aa88dabe3a94.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/9b4801b4efee261423a3aa88dabe3a94.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/9b4801b4efee261423a3aa88dabe3a94.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Wipe out all enemies with your deadly arsenals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/46fe05ec2ad96310a0d161e29e975f92.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/46fe05ec2ad96310a0d161e29e975f92.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/46fe05ec2ad96310a0d161e29e975f92.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIGNATURE WEAPONS</strong></h2><br>INDEX LASER : Laser beam emitted from index finger<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/75bfe1491d8f09df0b76e5adb6abd23f.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/75bfe1491d8f09df0b76e5adb6abd23f.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/75bfe1491d8f09df0b76e5adb6abd23f.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>FIST CANNON : Rapid fire triggered by holding your fist<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/a136e0560a1c85335cbb672c10133571.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/a136e0560a1c85335cbb672c10133571.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/a136e0560a1c85335cbb672c10133571.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>LIGHTNING : Electric arcs that will hit multi targets automatically<br><br>ULTRA BEAM : Long range palm laser. Warship killer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLESHIP SUPPORT</strong></h2><br>You are not fighting alone. Your battleship and fighter squadrons fight alongside you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/fed74e1a4f34ea01b1ef9c3137bee439.poster.avif?t=1585403341\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/fed74e1a4f34ea01b1ef9c3137bee439.webm?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/extras/fed74e1a4f34ea01b1ef9c3137bee439.mp4?t=1585403341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY INDEX CONTROLLER?</strong></h2><br>Hero Index delivers the superhero-like flying experience that everyone has dreamed of. Thanks to the innovative finger tracking of Index Controller, gesture-based fly and weapon control that was impossible with traditional motion controller becomes true for the first time.<br><br>As a game completely designed for Valve Index, Hero Index aggressively adopts finger gesture control without compromise.<br><br>Take the most iconic weapon, the index laser, as an example, <strong>for the first time in video game history, players can aim actually with their own index fingers and fire at will without pressing any button</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN I PLAY IT WITHOUT INDEX CONTROLLER?</strong></h2><br>Sort of. With the latest &quot;Escort&quot; update, Vive Wand and Oculus Touch users can do fly control and use limited weapons now. It is still experimental feature so might have issues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br>Control your fly direction and speed preciously with hand and finger motion.<br>No button is involved.<br><br>Fire your weapon by open your hand, hold your fist, or point with your index finger.<br>Do the right gesture, the right weapon fired, weapon switching can't be more seamless.<br>Again, no button is involved.<br><br>Breathtaking epic space battle experience tailored for the unique control mechanics.","developers":["FINGERTIP GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202560/header.jpg?t=1585403341","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2020 Fingertip Games. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1202560/274407/0a0dd2828634bda85764b5e0a56ecacf4e95adcc/1751203435/dash_av1.mpd?t=1585253579","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1202560/274407/0a0dd2828634bda85764b5e0a56ecacf4e